{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31808","headline":"送耿处士 · 贾岛","name":"送耿处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一瓶离别酒，未尽即言行。\n万水千山路，孤舟几月程。\n川原秋色静，芦苇晚风鸣。\n迢遰不归客，人传虚隐名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31808.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31808","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}